<p><big><b>Welcome to the Dragon Age Toolset documentation wiki!</b></big>
</p><p>The Dragon Age Toolset puts the power of the game developer in the palm of your hands. The Dragon Age Toolset will allow you to produce your own content including dungeons crawls, full-length campaigns, add-ons and cut-scenes you can share with friends and the BioWare community. 
</p><p>You can <a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://lvlt.bioware.cdn.ea.com/bioware/u/f/eagames/bioware/dragonage/toolset/DragonAgeToolset1.01Setup.exe">click here</a> to download Dragon Age Toolset  v1.01 from the Bioware CDN.
</p><p>For assistance with installing or running the game, or for issues regarding BioWare-published content, see the <a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://dragonagekeep.com/">Dragon Age Keep</a>.
</p>
